# Root `Gabriel` is a junction/symlink to `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel`. Ignore it so
# Git does not list a duplicate untracked tree (root is outside `Custom/Scripts/`
# but still matched by global `!**/*.cs` and similar negation rules).
/Gabriel/
prefs.json
